    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D RPG with an intergenerational respawn mechanic, where whenever you die you continue to play as one of your children or siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world containing\u00a0a city with 5 different families, a forest, and a dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduce women by dodging undertale-like bullet patterns.\u00a0Make sure to not confuse the women with the traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealthily sneak past her parents at night in her house to get to her room and create a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up the genetic stats of your characters over multiple generations. Women with higher stats are usually harder to date, because other admirers get in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your characters heroically die in battle, fighting goblins in the forest, to rescue women with particularly high stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are superstitious, you can sacrifice your first-born son to Baal, although it's unclear whether that does anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and seduce the mermaid to unlock a dungeon filled with dangerous monsters. Conquer the dungeon to beat the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D RPG with an intergenerational respawn mechanic, where whenever you die you continue to play as one of your children or siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world containing\u00a0a city with 5 different families, a forest, and a dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduce women by dodging undertale-like bullet patterns.\u00a0Make sure to not confuse the women with the traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealthily sneak past her parents at night in her house to get to her room and create a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up the genetic stats of your characters over multiple generations. Women with higher stats are usually harder to date, because other admirers get in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your characters heroically die in battle, fighting goblins in the forest, to rescue women with particularly high stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are superstitious, you can sacrifice your first-born son to Baal, although it's unclear whether that does anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and seduce the mermaid to unlock a dungeon filled with dangerous monsters. Conquer the dungeon to beat the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "RPG with intergenerational respawn mechanic: If you die you continue to play as one of your children. The gameplay is focused on dating and stealth.",
